120x30
|project                                                                                 at terminal · as the room allows
|
|Move ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
|  ↑ ↓  k j scroll the help
|  ← →  h l choose a story beside
|  ⏎        open the component's stories
|  esc      leave the help
|
|Find ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
|  /        filter the components
|  n N      next or previous match
|  ⏎        keep what is typed
|  backspace erase the last character
|
|Picture ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
|  p        show the next viewport
|  v        set the stories as the room allows, in rows, or side by side
|  d        show the golden over the picture
|  c        read the cells under a cursor
|  A        accept the picture as its golden
|
|App ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
|  ?        close the help
|  q        quit
|
|  the pictures are drawn by the project's own vitest, which draws a stories file again when it is saved

